  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TVET through UGEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Peru Office is concluding a TVET policy review which will make recommendations to accelerate TVET training implementation processes. In addition, we have been training teachers from secondary schools in rural areas, reaching more than 80 teachers from 35 schools.
Continuing with this effort, we propose to provide technical assistance to the Local Educational Management Units (UGEL) of 4 regions of the country and accompany their specialists to design and implement a technical education offer according to the needs of their respective territories and then provide assistance technical support to UGEL specialists to follow up on their visits to schools to verify the application of the pedagogical tools of the training received in the years 2022 and 2023. This support involves reinforcing TVET training, verifying that students receive the training in schools.</narrative>
  </description>
